<p>darbaar me jab kat ke yatimo'n ke sar aaye<br />
doobe huwe do chand lahu me nazar aaye<br />
ghul padgaya muslim ke ye laqte jigar aaye<br />
ghurbat zada-o- be watan-o- be pidar aaye</p>

<p>shamsheer-e- sitam chal gayi in nouhagaro'n par<br />
kya bekasi-o- yaas barasti hai saro'n par<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>haakim se ye tab kehne laga haaris -e- bad kaam<br />
sar bachhou ke laaya hu mile qillat -o- inaam<br />
pahchaan le muslim ke pisar hai yahi gulfaam<br />
ye wo hai jo zindaan se bhaage the sar-e- shaam</p>

<p>mai dhoondta phirta tha na haath aate the dono<br />
paate the jidhar raah nikal jaate the dono<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>haakim ne kaha tune kaha'n phir inhe paaya<br />
taarikiye shab me nazar aata nahi saaya<br />
wo jod ke haathou ko suqan lab pa ye laaya<br />
zouja ne meri tha unhe hujre me chupaya</p>

<p>mai kehta tha dil me ke kaha'n jaake chupe hai<br />
iski na khabar thi mere ghar aake chupe hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>az bas ke thaka tha, mujhe neend aagayi usdam<br />
kya dekhta hu aalam-e-rooya me basad gham<br />
ek hujre me do tifl nazar aate hai baaham<br />
sar peet ke kehte hai wo baa dida e purnam</p>

<p>aafat me phanse ham dar-e- zindaa'n se nikal ke<br />
maloom huwa padgaye phande me ajal ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chillaye jo wo haaye pidar kehke dilafgaar<br />
tha neend me ya aankh meri khul gayi ekbaar<br />
khush hogaya mai taala-e- qafta huwe bedaar<br />
bistar se utha haath me khainche huwe talwaar</p>

<p>ek hujre me muslim ke wo pyare nazar aaye<br />
baalaa e zami'n arsh ke taare nazar aae<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jakda jo unhe mai ne to karte the ye faryaad<br />
mehmaa'n tere ghar aaye hai ham bekas-o- nashaad<br />
bin baap ke hai ham pa taras kha sitaam eijaad<br />
le minnate'n karte hai teri chod de jallad</p>

<p>kar rahem ke masoom hai dukh paaye hai zaalim<br />
ham chupne ko daaman me tere aaye hai zaalim<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mai ne kaha tum dono ke baba ka hai kya naam<br />
ro kar kaha kehte hai unhe muslim-e- nakaam<br />
be jurm-o- qataa unke gale par chali samsaam<br />
ham jab se chute baap se ham ko nahi aaram</p>

<p>dehshat se teri seene me dil hilte hai zaalim<br />
ab dheeli rasan kar ke gale chilte hai zaalim<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye sunte hi masoomo'n pa ghussa mujhe aaya<br />
hujre se unhe khainchte dailaan me laaya<br />
un dono ne jo zulm na dekha tha dikhaya<br />
mujrim ki tarha baandh diya reham na khaya</p>

<p>baahar unhe le aaya jo zulfo'n ko pakad kar<br />
istaada kiya chob se rassi me jakad kar<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>samjha na wo hargis na mera dhyaan me laayi<br />
junjhla ke use teghe sitam mai ne lagaayi<br />
ek waar me sa-aa se giri kat ke kalaayi<br />
chilla ke lagi dene payambar ki duhaayi</p>

<p>hae hae mere aaqa meri imdad ko pahoncho<br />
aye shah-e- gharibaa'n meri faryaad ko pahoncho<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jab maar chuka usko to masoomo'n ko khaincha<br />
pakde huwe zulfe'n unhe laaya labe darya<br />
rokar kaha bachho'n ne hame qatl na karna<br />
maarega jo hamko tere kya haath lagega</p>

<p>bekas hai musafir hai aur aawaraa watan hai<br />
ye kya hai saza kam ke giraftaare mehan hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kar rahem sitamgaar gharibi pa hamaari<br />
dewega sila iska tujhe qaaleq-e- baari<br />
le aankh na dikhla inhe ab karne ke zaari<br />
chal kar sar-e- baazar hame bechle naari</p>

<p>bach jaayenge ham qillat-o- zar paayega zalim<br />
gar qatl kiya hamko to pachtayega zalim<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye sunke badha mai ju hi khainche huwe talwar<br />
pahlu me baradar ke baradar gira ek baar<br />
mai chaati pa ek tifl ki aaqir huwa sawaar<br />
jab halq pa bacche ke rakha qanjar -e- qoo'nqaar</p>

<p>ek hashr bapaa hogaya qanjar ke chale par<br />
bhai ne gala rakh diya bhai ke gale par<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>